Characteristics:
Simple to implement.
Predictable pricing for all participants.
Use Case:
Useful for fundraising rounds where you want all participants to pay the same price, or in stablecoin systems where price volatility must be minimized.
11. Geometric Bonding Curve

In a geometric curve, the price increases based on a geometric progression. This model makes price increases occur at a gradually accelerating rate, although not as sharply as an exponential curve.

Formula:
𝑃
